sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User ( Rahul )
    participant LK as LiveKit Room
    participant Lock as Speaking Lock
    participant Bot as Active Bot (Speaking)

    Bot->>LK: Publishing Audio Stream ("Machine learning mein...")
    Lock->>Lock: State: SPEAKING (Owner: roxstar-ai-dost)
    User->>LK: Speaks ("Ruko, simple example se samjhao")
    LK->>Lock: Audio VAD Interrupt Triggered
    Lock->>Bot: Send AbortSignal / Cancel TTS Task
    Bot->>LK: Stop Audio Track Publication
    Lock->>Lock: Reset State: IDLE
    Lock->>LK: Trigger Next Turn Processing
